      "refersTo": "panel-status",
      "description": "Text plus a small dot; status is not a pill or a color-only signal.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-panel-status\">Pending</span>",
      "css": ".ds-panel-status{font-family:var(--font-body,Arial),sans-serif;font-size:13px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;color:#58697c}.ds-panel-status::before{content:\"\";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#b45309}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Inbox boundary",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "panel-inbox",
      "description": "A single rounded working surface; interior rows stay flat.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel-inbox\"><h2>Requests</h2><p>Review requests and plan the next step.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel-inbox{font-family:var(--font-body,Arial),sans-serif;font-size:13px;border:1px solid #dde4eb;border-radius:16px;background:#fff;color:#172b43;padding:22px 24px 18px}.ds-panel-inbox h2{font-family:var(--font-body,Arial),sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;margin:0}.ds-panel-inbox p{color:#58697c;margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Care tool destination",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "panel-tool",
      "description": "Ruled directory destinations, with descriptions on desktop.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-panel-tool\" href=\"#patients\"><span>Patients</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg><p>Find a patient and open their record.</p></a>",
      "css": ".ds-panel-tool{font-family:var(--font-body,Arial),sans-serif;font-size:13px;display:block;position:relative;min-height:44px;padding:20px 22px;color:#172b43;border-block:1px solid #dde4eb;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 160ms cubic-bezier(.25,1,.5,1)}.ds-panel-tool span{font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.ds-panel-tool svg{position:absolute;right:22px;top:22px;color:#58697c;transition:transform 160ms cubic-bezier(.25,1,.5,1)}.ds-panel-tool p{max-width:30ch;margin:8px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#58697c}.ds-panel-tool:hover{background:#edf3f9}.ds-panel-tool:hover svg{transform:translateX(3px)}.ds-panel-tool:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-sapphire,#1d3557);outline-offset:2px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-panel-tool,.ds-panel-tool svg{transition:none}.ds-panel-tool:hover svg{transform:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected request row",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "panel-request-selected",
      "description": "Selection surface and outline identify the open request.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-panel-row\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><strong>Fictional patient</strong><p>Made-up request for a follow-up appointment.</p><span>Pending</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-panel-row{font-family:var(--font-body,Arial),sans-serif;font-size:13px;display:block;position:relative;width:100%;min-height:44px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #9eb4cc;padding:20px;background:#edf3f9;color:#172b43;cursor:pointer}.ds-panel-row strong{font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.ds-panel-row p{margin:5px 0 10px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:#58697c}.ds-panel-row span{font-size:12px;color:#58697c}.ds-panel-row:hover{background:#f8fafb}.ds-panel-row[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:#edf3f9}.ds-panel-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-sapphire,#1d3557);outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Patient portrait",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "patient-portrait",
      "description": "Contained rectangular identity portrait, with initials fallback; production image triggers open the native viewer.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-patient-portrait\" aria-label=\"View image: Fictional patient\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">FP</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-patient-portrait{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;width:104px;height:120px;overflow:hidden;border:0;border-radius:16px;background:var(--panel-selection,#edf3f9);color:var(--color-sapphire,#1d3557);font:600 1.75rem var(--font-body,Arial),sans-serif;cursor:zoom-in}.ds-patient-portrait img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain}.ds-patient-portrait:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-sapphire,#1d3557);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:639px){.ds-patient-portrait{width:76px;height:92px;font-size:1.375rem}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Patient gallery thumbnail",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "patient-thumbnail",
      "description": "Uncropped 4:3 attachment frame. This self-contained sample uses the production unavailable state; production thumbnails open a native image dialog.",
      "html": "<figure class=\"ds-patient-photo\"><button class=\"ds-patient-thumbnail\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"View image: Example attachment\"><span class=\"ds-patient-unavailable\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Example attachment\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"1\"/><path d=\"m3 17 5-5 4 4 3-3 6 6\"/></svg>This image could not be displayed.</span><span class=\"ds-patient-open\">View image</span></button><figcaption>Example attachment</figcaption></figure>",
      "css": ".ds-patient-photo{margin:0;max-width:280px;font-family:var(--font-body,Arial),sans-serif}.ds-patient-thumbnail{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--panel-line,#dde4eb);border-radius:12px;background:var(--panel-subtle,#f8fafb);cursor:zoom-in}.ds-patient-thumbnail img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;padding:12px;transition:opacity 160ms ease-out}.ds-patient-thumbnail:hover img{opacity:.8}.ds-patient-thumbnail:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--color-sapphire,#1d3557);outline-offset:3px}.ds-patient-unavailable{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--panel-muted,#58697c)}.ds-patient-open{position:absolute;right:8px;bottom:8px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--panel-surface,#fff);color:var(--panel-ink,#172b43);font-size:.75rem}.ds-patient-photo figcaption{padding-top:12px;color:var(--panel-ink,#172b43);font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-patient-thumbnail img{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Cabinet current destination",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "cabinet-navigation-active",
      "description": "Persistent patient navigation: a pale current destination, unlike filled staff sidebar selection. Real section switching remains in PatientPortalView.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-cabinet-nav\" aria-label=\"Patient care\"><button type=\"button\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8Z\"/><path d=\"M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h6\"/></svg><span>Overview</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-cabinet-nav{width:220px;max-width:100%;font-family:var(--font-body,Arial),sans-serif}.ds-cabinet-nav button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:48px;width:100%;padding:12px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--panel-muted,#58697c);font-family:inherit;font-size:.9375rem;line-height:1.4;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-cabinet-nav button:hover{background:var(--panel-subtle,#f8fafb);color:var(--panel-ink,#172b43)}.ds-cabinet-nav button[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:var(--panel-selection,#edf3f9);color:var(--color-sapphire,#1d3557);font-weight:600}.ds-cabinet-nav button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-sapphire,#1d3557);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:639px){.ds-cabinet-nav button{flex-direction:column;text-align:center;font-size:.8125rem}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Clinical authority with community warmth",
    "overview": "RediHealth pairs clinical authority with community warmth. The public experience stays editorial and accessible. Staff screens use the same identity within a pale slate workspace, white working surfaces, sapphire destinations, and fine dividing rules.\n\nThe staff panel is a scoped expression of the incumbent system, not a global rebrand. Its composition is recorded in `.impeccable/surfaces/src-app-panel-page-tsx.md`; future public pages continue to follow the public rules below.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Readable typography and predictable hierarchy.",
      "Sapphire staff actions, with emergency red retaining its established role.",
      "Flat working surfaces and clear selection feedback.",
      "Seven-language parity and accessible comfort controls."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Scoped Sapphire Rule",
        "body": "Within the care panel, the legacy primary CSS alias resolves to sapphire. The global primary token stays emergency red; public Button variant rules remain authoritative.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve public design rules when extending the staff workspace.",
      "Do keep panel colors scoped to the care panel and retain the existing logo.",
      "Do derive counts and clinical content from the runtime; label fictional demo data.",
      "Do preserve all seven locales, keyboard focus, touch targets, and reduced motion.",
      "Do preserve the full image frame in identity, gallery, inline preview, and print.",
      "Do keep inspection keyboard-accessible and return focus to its trigger.",
      "Do preserve all six cabinet destinations on phones and keep patient data ahead of everyday actions."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't export the staff workspace composition or token overrides to public pages.",
      "Don't use emergency red for routine staff actions.",
      "Don't invent statistics or present browser-local demo records as live data.",
      "Don't replace role and runtime visibility checks with decorative tool links.",
      "Don't destructively crop patient documents or claim a downscaled portrait is an untouched original.",
      "Don't supply the demo transport callback to the real token route or treat local simulation as authentication evidence."
    ]
  }
}
